<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Attachment> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Attachment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A media file carried by an item under content/attachments/<slug>/ (AGSC-02-98); IRI <item-IRI>#attachment-<n> (AGSC-05-29). Pattern images are SVG only."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Attachment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Attachment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Attachment"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Attachment> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Bundle> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Bundle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One directory tree of items published together; the concept scheme every Concept is in."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Bundle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Bundle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bundle"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Bundle> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Cluster> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Cluster> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A navigational grouping of items. Membership is skos:member, authored on the item. Cluster nesting is also skos:member — never skos:broader, which would put a Collection in a semantic relation."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Cluster> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Cluster> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Cluster"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Cluster> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Collection> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A unit of knowledge in a Bundle: a pattern, taxonomy, explainer, principle, decision, spec, task, term or architecture, distinguished by asc:kind."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Concept"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A recorded occurrence — a session, run or incident — with a start, an actor and an outcome."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Episode"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A declared set of checks that a change must pass; its runs are Episodes."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Gate"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Gate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Harness> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Harness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A generated bundle of files assembled from a validated composition of Concepts; never authored, never stored under content/."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Harness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Harness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Harness"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Harness> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Lesson> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Lesson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Knowledge distilled from one or more Episodes, carrying a severity; a Concept by essence."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Lesson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Lesson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lesson"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Lesson> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An executable-by-a-reader plan: trigger, steps and checks. Exports one-to-one to a skill file."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Procedure"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Procedure> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Proposal> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Proposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A proposed change to a Bundle. It has no file: it is a forge pull request, instantiated in exports from the derived git log."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Proposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Proposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Proposal"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Proposal> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The human assessment of a Proposal. It has no file: it is instantiated from a verified[] entry at the IRI <item-IRI>#review-<n>, its actor and instant carried by asc:verifiedBy and asc:verifiedAt (AGSC-05-15)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Review"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Source> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An external work cited by an item. It has no file: it is instantiated from a sources[] entry."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Source"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Source> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blockedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blockedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mode-2 key 13: the subject cannot proceed until the object is resolved. No domain, range or super-property (AGSC-05-26a). Combiner semantics: none."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blockedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blockedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "blocked by"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blockedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blocks> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blocks> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blocks> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Computed inverse of asc:blockedBy; never authored."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blocks> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blocks> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "blocks"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blocks> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#blockedBy> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#consumes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#consumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A port type name this item consumes (AGSC-02-96, AGSC-05-30)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#consumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#consumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#consumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "consumes"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#consumes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#contradicts> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#contradicts> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#contradicts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserts that two items cannot both be true. Selecting both in a composition is a warning, never a failure. No domain or range is declared: any item type may author this key, and declaring asc:Concept would entail a Concept typing for Procedures, Episodes and Gates."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#contradicts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#contradicts> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "contradicts"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#coveredBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#coveredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Computed inverse of asc:covers; never authored."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#coveredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#coveredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "covered by"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#coveredBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#covers> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#covers> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#covers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mode-2 key 12: the subject covers the object (a test, a check or a document covering a requirement). Combiner semantics: none."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#covers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#covers> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "covers"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#covers> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#coveredBy> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decidedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decidedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mode-2 key 14: the subject was settled by the object, a decision item. Combiner semantics: none."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decidedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decidedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "decided by"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decidedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decides> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decides> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decides> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Computed inverse of asc:decidedBy; never authored."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decides> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decides> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "decides"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decides> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#decidedBy> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#excludes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#excludes> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#excludes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Asserts mutual exclusion. Evaluated after the requires closure; a surviving pair invalidates a composition. No domain or range is declared, for the reason given on asc:contradicts."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#excludes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#excludes> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "excludes"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#generatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#generatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instant at which an item was generated, with an explicit UTC offset."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#generatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#generatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "generated at"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#generatedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#generatedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
