<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#taskState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One of the nine Agent2Agent 1.0 task states, verbatim (AGSC-02-99, AGSC-10-13)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#taskState> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Concept> .
