<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#usedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#usedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Computed inverse of asc:uses; never authored. No domain or range is declared, for the reason given on asc:contradicts."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#usedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#usedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "used by"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#usedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#uses> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#uses> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#uses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Soft dependency: the subject draws on the object. A composition warns when a used item is absent. No domain, range or super-property is declared: skos:related is a sub-property of skos:semanticRelation, whose domain and range are skos:Concept (S19/S20), so a super-property axiom would re-introduce the unintended Concept typing and the S37 contradiction for Clusters (AGSC-05-26a)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#uses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#uses> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "uses"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#uses> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#usedBy> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedAt> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instant at which a human recorded a Review, with an explicit UTC offset."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "verified at"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedAt> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Actor string of the human who recorded a Review."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Review> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "verified by"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedBy> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Instant at which a Source was last checked to resolve; an authored YYYY-MM-DD date is rendered as that day's midnight UTC instant. xsd:date is not in the OWL 2 datatype map, so xsd:dateTime keeps the ontology inside OWL 2 RL (AGSC-05-14, AGSC-05-22)."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#Source> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "verified on"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifiedOn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifies> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Mode-2 key 11: the subject checks that the object holds. Its computed inverse is asc:isVerifiedBy (the datatype property asc:verifiedBy carries a Review actor and is unrelated). Combiner semantics: none."^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "verifies"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#verifies> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <https://w3id.org/agentic-system-core/ns#isVerifiedBy> .
